      "number": 33,
      "question": "The volume of a cube is 216 cm³. Find its surface area.",
      "options": {
        "A": "144 cm²",
        "B": "196 cm²",
        "C": "216 cm²",
        "D": "256 cm²"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Side = cube root(216) = 6. Surface Area = 6 * a^2 = 6 * 36 = 216.",
      "hash": "cc867419d7e95248",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक घन का आयतन 216 सेमी³ है। इसका पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "144 सेमी²",
            "B": "196 सेमी²",
            "C": "216 सेमी²",
            "D": "256 सेमी²"
          },
          "explanation": "भुजा = cube root(216) = 6। पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल = 6 * a^2 = 6 * 36 = 216।"
        }
      }
